#==============================================================================================
#
#   resource_loader_3 - ResourceLoader::load and its network requests
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Loader/ResourceLoader.cpp (lines 354-522): load, which
#       dispatches on the URL's scheme, and the network request's start, response headers and
#       finish. load's lambdas share one capture struct (ResourceLoaderLoad), made in managed
#       memory, holding the copy of the LoadRequest the C++ lambdas capture and the three
#       callbacks (GC::Root in C++: the struct's scan keeps them).
#
#       Copyright (c) 2018-2024, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
